Description: Keep client move and stacking requests with a separate native raster
 .
 Consume only the native width and height fields for one-view windows, then retain ordinary ConfigureRequest handling for position, border and stacking. A combined client move and raster change fails at both scales before this fix; the complete X11 suite now passes 230 cases.
